          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="cac1-7b0a-16fe-0366" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="3"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Warbringer Nemesis Titan" id="6d3c-6f16-e5f9-c116" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">12"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">14</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">80</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">20</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size"></characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Striding Colossus" id="a200-f566-39e9-83fc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time you target the unit with a Stratagem, Stratagems that target the unit cost three times their stated CP cost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Super-heavy Walker" id="ef77-f0e0-84b1-9110" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; When this model ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over non-Titanic models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over terrain features 4" or lower as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
  -&gt; The triggering unit cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over terrain features over 4" as though they were not there.
-&gt; When this model moves through terrain over 4" tall:
  -&gt; Roll one D6:
    - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
    - On 2-6: Nothing happens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Titanic Fire Support" id="0b52-b0dc-3ca5-92b9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence (your Titanic Fire Support Target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, if the triggering wound roll was a critical, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1 if it is made by a friendly IMPERIUM unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="af3b-5e5c-8b95-cc30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged Objective Control" id="a585-60bd-339b-3ca9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model is Damaged, subtract its rating from this model's Objective Control characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="1499-fb33-9202-58bf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
