            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; When this model ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over non-Titanic models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over terrain features 4" or lower as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
